{
  "_comment": [
    "Hardware wiring for MOE and its GSE, for the --driver=stand composite driver.",
    "Pass it with --hardware-config=config/hardware-moe.json; the startup",
    "window does this for you when MOE is the chosen stand.",
    "",
    "DC channels follow the MOE/GSE connection diagram (solenoid box",
    "connectors 1-8, pins 1,4 / 2,3 -> PANDA V2.2 DC1-DC16):",
    "  1 Fuel Press     2 LOX Press      3 Fuel Vent     4 LOX Vent",
    "  5 Main Fuel      6 Main Oxygen    7 Fuel Fill     8 GN2 Vent",
    "  9 Gnd LOX Fill  10 Gnd LOX Vent  11 Gnd GN2 Vent  12 Gnd GN2 Press",
    " 13 LOX QD Ctrl   14 GN2 QD Ctrl   15 GN2 BB Press  16 Gnd Pneu Vent",
    "(1-4, 7, 8, 13, 14 and 16 corrected from the diagram by bench actuation.)",
    "Change the channel on the valve in moe.json AND the dcChannels entry",
    "below together if the harness changes.",
    "",
    "PTs follow the same diagram's PT connector numbering. PT1 (LOX tank)",
    "and PT2 (fuel tank) are the PANDA's own bang-bang inputs, mux A ch 0",
    "and 1, read from the 'P' line: the board-scaled PSI its bang-bang",
    "loop acts on (bbpt0, bbpt1). GN2 BUS PT is the third, mux A ch 2",
    "(bbpt2), which the GN2 bang-bang side regulates on; it is no longer",
    "read on the NI-9208 (was ai4). The rest are on the NI-9208 (connector",
    "PTn -> ai(n-1)). maxPsi is a placeholder sized to each line; set it",
    "from the installed transducers."
  ],
  "_stand": "Which stand this wiring belongs to. Checked against meta.standName in the stand config at startup.",
